{"version":1,"key":"card:155","content":{"id":155,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"0d3c9838-24a4-47e1-9774-4b2fb8c7cb3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 CSS 我们可以为标签添加样式，那么为哪一个标签添加样式，怎么给特定的标签添加样式，这就需要用到 CSS 选择器。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"0222d2ee-5b1a-424c-9109-c64f703c202a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"d28ffdc8-178f-49d7-ae36-d3209541c758","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接通过标签来为标签添加样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"4935d493-1958-4ecf-8ffe-d3234bcacdc9","collabId":"4dfce277-49bb-445f-85f1-b402451b1213","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<p>酒一杯一杯的干</p>"},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"6265f92a-de3a-4470-8979-fe93dbe9e21f","collabId":"8b340379-f8c4-4c5e-bfb3-c7a094507bcf","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"p {\n  color: brown;\n}"},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"06c377a2-40f1-44ae-99e0-d8f4d9e9051f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"cfd69e5f-ed9b-4239-8900-121f4a746536","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器会为所有的标签添加样式，如果只是想为特定的标签添加样式的话就比较难"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"95fd9abb-ec5c-43c4-8d44-e4833dd02bed","collabId":"4a9fd016-9f8c-471a-a953-450c9d52e496","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<p>床前明月光</p>\n<p>疑是地上霜</p>"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"ff49161b-dfe0-4acb-a707-f0d647ed8ce6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们想为第二个 p 标签添加样式，第一个 p 标签不要添加样式，明显通过标签选择器是无法做到的，这个时候我们需要用到类选择器。我们为第二个 p 标签添加 class 属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"e12a2aca-34c9-485e-90c5-64418087607e","collabId":"b92c168b-c0e5-420c-b42b-6b6a2c52ac2f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".red {\n  color: red;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"05bd8a5e-74f6-4313-9e86-d37abb94d308","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器的格式是 .类名，它会选择所有包含该类名的标签，为其添加样式。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"0bb28ccc-b4ce-4022-90ae-debfdabe6ae9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个标签可以添加多个类名，类名之间使用空格分开"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"f63907c4-8ae8-4604-9d90-707c60fec4dc","collabId":"bd918e15-f8a1-43bf-9522-1c32da2e185c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<p>床前明月光</p>\n<p class=\"red double\">疑是地上霜</p>"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"6f0cb0cd-f485-4df2-b689-77024e00bbaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为第二个 p 标签添加了两个类名，red 和 double，现在我们为这两个类分别设置样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"d3e83657-c165-445c-bb30-66079ee35d28","collabId":"90746f67-f7f4-4d74-9f30-7518e7d78b78","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".red {\n  color: red;\n}\n.double {\n  font-size: 2em;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"abc0cfb3-fcbb-4c0b-ae2a-95d53047d4ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们为第二个 p 标签应用了两个样式，字体颜色为红色以及字体大小为原先的两倍。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"949aafb4-3654-4a75-a1d9-c0908f26a96f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"b8913c40-7993-47b2-b300-dc6fb6e7c3bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以为标签添加一个 id 属性，然后通过 id 来选择相应的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"33509161-cfb5-4e0c-a945-f288a652e6c9","collabId":"f5282e46-0762-4b8f-8b68-240c2ff4b95f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<p id=\"moon\">举头望明月</p>\n<p>低头思故乡</p>"},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"f075004f-74b9-4857-93ee-acd1c5efaaaa","collabId":"b12415c3-9597-4cc8-a28f-6b54c3751e57","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"#moon {\n  color: yellow;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"9de81d59-0d33-48f7-929d-7ce4b80c770f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器的写法为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"#id"},{"type":"formatted","text":"名，它会选择包含此 id 名的标签。在使用上，id 选择器和类选择器相差不大，写法有所不同，除此之外它们之间还有个很大的不同，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"每一个标签只有一个 id，且与其他标签的 id 不会重复"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 id 选择器只会选择一个特定的标签，而类选择器可能有多个标签能被选中，不同的标签可以有相同的类名。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"89210792-453b-49db-8ff5-2b014a3db9b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性选择器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"d2ce0fee-6df2-4709-82cc-78158a7cdbd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过属性选择器来选择标签，它会选择所有包含此属性的标签"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"8bb69f37-3e68-44fd-8e4b-e94888363b27","collabId":"f2fef701-4165-40c6-b80a-18ec5bf92180","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"[type] {\n  /* 选择包含 type 属性的标签 */\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"ab80b517-df5f-48e2-9d8e-6be6d0aca71f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性选择器的格式为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"e2f476f6-e827-4a29-ba1b-545e4aa11605","collabId":"5549a926-0a4b-40e6-a67b-1f9bdd11ba62","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"[属性名]"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"6e529fc4-c9d7-4cda-bf5c-b66936bfec6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此之外，我们还可以限定属性值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"8365deba-3a66-4219-8279-de6d483f4741","collabId":"65e260bc-7f49-49d6-a37d-6a9769e19f03","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"[type=\"text\"] {\n  /* 选择 type 属性值为 text 的标签 */\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"242815b1-11fa-4326-8aa8-ea6e906ab3c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性值的限定不一定是具体的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"b4cc5588-e9e3-4c86-b4ea-c175329fad08","collabId":"487e8495-7ab3-4240-a163-9544d423402e","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"[class^=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名以 a 开头的标签 */\n}\n[class$=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名以 a 结尾的标签 */\n}\n[class*=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名包含 a 的标签 */\n}"}],"tags":["CSS/选择器"],"createTime":1690212303728,"updateTime":1792286709624,"linkedCards":[{"id":156,"target":{"key":"card:156","type":"card","id":156},"summary":"除了基本的选择器，CSS 还提供了一些高级的选择器，提供更多的灵活性。 后代选择器 看一个🌰： <div> <p>简单的 p 标签</p> <ul> <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li> <li><p>li里面的p标签</p>...","tags":["CSS/选择器"]},{"id":207,"target":{"key":"card:207","type":"card","id":207},"summary":"document 包含一系列查找元素的方法，包括： getElementById getElementByTagName getElementByClassName getElementByName querySelector queryS...","tags":["DOM"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792286709624}}